schema_id swath/vercel-objects/v1
message swath_listing
key_unique true
max_key_bytes 0
column key BYTE_ARRAY STRING required delta
column size INT64 INT(64,true) required max_bytes 0 accessor int
column created_at INT64 TIMESTAMP(MICROS,UTC) required max_bytes 0 accessor int
column etag BYTE_ARRAY STRING optional delta max_bytes 0 accessor str
